{"seq":14,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:34:50.151Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"28e4f8b1f7193e38030bba754560efcf2275aed02e001fdbf1567e4ff5961aa1","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"Ruth, from Moss's Strategic digests (the digests mostly say \"Gideon's…\" / \"Nadia's…\" rather than naming an owner in each line, so I matched them up by description):\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account until the handoff. The 5/4 digest says \"Nadia's old industrial account\" was reassigned, and the 8/3 digest and the QBR plan call it \"Gideon's biggest account\".\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he \"also assumed management\" of it that day, and the 9/30 digest shows him running it.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, but this is inferred. The 9/30 digest lists Orlavine and has a separate item for \"Gideon's medical account\", and the 12/1/25 digest also says \"Gideon's medical account\". An older digest (3/10/25) called the medical account Nadia's, so it moved at some point. No digest gives the date.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: I can't confirm an owner. The digests only call it the pod's retail or outdoor account. The 9/30 digest has Nadia volunteering to host a training session for them, which isn't proof she owns it. Check the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n\nVantorre Group changed hands on 2026-05-04 (Monday). The 5/3 Sunday-prep digest says \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms it was reassigned in the CRM that day.\n\nThe digests are my only source. I couldn't find account or CRM files to cross-check.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:34:50.324Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c09c24ad8efaa35570b61f037e90a5720040107845b0c40f7db53a03996d894e","actor":null,"via":"runner","tool":"gbrain.ingest","kind":"admin","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","author":"assistant","source":"channel-strategic-pod"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"fact_id":"2","source":"channel-strategic-pod","latency_ms":172,"status":"inserted"}}
{"seq":16,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:34:54.692Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"dd355937f75743b203fe22094f7214e6ea0aa5ab7b39524589acd89c7c6d739c","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, I posted the answer in your thread in #strategic-pod. Moss's digests mostly say \"Gideon's…\" or \"Nadia's…\" instead of naming an owner in each line, so I matched accounts by description.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account until the handoff.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he \"also assumed management\" of it that day.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, but that is inferred. The 9/30 digest lists Orlavine and also has an item for \"Gideon's medical account\". An older digest (3/10/25) called the medical account Nadia's, so it moved at some point. No digest gives the date.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't confirm an owner. The digests only call it the pod's retail or outdoor account. I told you to check the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n- **Vantorre Group changed hands on 2026-05-04.** The 5/3 digest says it changes hands \"tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest says it was reassigned in the CRM that day.\n\nThe digests were my only source. I found no account or CRM files to cross-check against."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
